OL,3,GNEWSABid to extend mural wins approval
OL,4,
OL,5,FPlans to extend a prominent outdoor
OL,6,Fmural on a Grade II listed building in
OL,7,Fa North Yorkshire town centre have been
OL,8,Fapproved by councillors.
OL,10,FThey voted in favour of the application
OL,11,Fby North Yorkshire Council for the
OL,12,Fartwork at 3 West Square in
OL,13,FScarborough.
OL,15,FThe council said the aim was to enhance
OL,16,Fthe town centre by fostering a
OL,17,F"stronger sense of civic pride", but
OL,18,Fsome residents argued the design lacked
OL,19,F"sufficient artistic quality".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
