OL,3,GNEWSABid to extend mural wins approval
OL,4,
OL,5,FHowever, during last week's meeting,
OL,6,Fcouncillors were reminded that the
OL,7,Fapplication was for listed building
OL,8,Fconsent and not for judgment on the
OL,9,Fdesign.
